# ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Note: generated AVIF/WebP variants in images/ ARE committed.
# They're produced by scripts/optimize-images.sh and served directly
# by Vercel (no build step). Do NOT add *.avif/*.webp to this file —
# committing them is what makes the static deploy work.
